    "correctIndex": 0,
    "solutionText": "Diya hai: sec θ + tan θ = 5 ... (1)\n\nStep 1: Identity use karo:\nsec²θ − tan²θ = 1\n⟹ (sec θ + tan θ)(sec θ − tan θ) = 1\n\nStep 2: Value daalo:\n5 × (sec θ − tan θ) = 1\n⟹ sec θ − tan θ = 1/5 ... (2)\n\nStep 3: (1) aur (2) ko add/subtract karo:\n\nAdd karne par:\n2 sec θ = 5 + 1/5 = 26/5\n⟹ sec θ = 13/5\n\nSubtract karne par:\n2 tan θ = 5 − 1/5 = 24/5\n⟹ tan θ = 12/5\n\nStep 4: sin θ nikaalo:\nsin θ = tan θ / sec θ = (12/5) ÷ (13/5) = 12/13\n\n✅ Answer: sin θ = 12/13",
